; OVERLAY (bazel/ocaml/semgrep_src/overlays) -- replaces the upstream dune.
;
; Preserve the one upstream Space_main program and its direct libraries, while
; rewriting plural `(executables)`/`names`/`public_names` to the translator's
; supported singular form. Also remove `(flags (:include flags.sexp))` and its
; generic generator rule. Upstream flags.sh selects link policy by OS, opam
; switch, Alpine, Nix, and FORCE_DYNLINK. For the supported non-Alpine Linux
; dynamic build that policy emits no extra flags. Bazel supplies Spacegrep's
; actual PCRE/PCRE2 native archives through cc_deps; it has no language grammar
; dependency. The translator rejects the removed include and plural stanza at
; fetch time, so both changes stay explicit here.
(executable
 (name Space_main)
 (public_name spacegrep)
 (package spacegrep)
 (libraries
  spacegrep
  cmdliner))
